 "_about": "MANDATE prototype role catalogue (declared mandates). A tool's resource sensitivity: 0 public, 1 internal, 2 personal/financial, 3 restricted (HR salary). source=untrusted means the output can carry third-party content (indirect prompt injection vector). Destinations: 'internal' or an external host pattern. E2 additions: max_per_window/budget_window_s (effect budgets), max_identical_per_window (duplicate consequential actions), trusted_store (writes create content others will trust; under taint they are provenance-labelled untrusted), role max_rate_per_min (declared action-rate ceiling).",
